	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino, doctissime <persName ref="p2836">Heinryche</persName>, accepi literas tuas 3. octobris <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et ago tibi gratias pro novis illis rebus.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Et ego mirari soleo, quod <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nihil literarum ex <placeName ref="l284">Lipsia</placeName> acceperim; fortassis mittent ex nundinis <placeName ref="l284">Lipsensibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l361">Norimbergam</placeName> et ex <placeName ref="l361">Norimberga</placeName> ad nundinas nostras.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Etsi ex libris <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>facile coniicere licet, qualis status ecclesia sit in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>; nam, ut mihi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>videtur, <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> divisa est in tres partes: sunt evangelici puri, sunt adia<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>phoristę, sunt papistę, adde etiam... tam partem, sunt Interimistę.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sic dominus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nos probat variis modis et sectis ante diem suum extremum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Si aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>librorum vis emere, qui apud nos prostant ex <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgo</placeName>, poteris in <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tempore; <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberga</placeName> fere nihil dedit et mirum, cur id fiat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripsi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et puto te accepisse literas de rege <placeName>Tuneti</placeName>, quem aiunt ex vulnere mortuum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et de aliis rebus, quę a doctore quodam accepi, qui nuper <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> fuit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p1546">Duc Christophorus Wirtembergensis</persName> accedit patrem; aliquid novi instituit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>absque dubio, aut <persName>Udalricus</persName> dux aegro<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>t<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>at.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>inis<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>terium <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ev<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>angelii relinqueret aut aliud quid institueret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Mirari autem soleo, cur <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName>, affinis tuus, detrectarit reddere <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Oecolampadiana in linguam Latinam, quum id promiserit non semel et quum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>habeam typographum, qui obtulit se velle omnia praeceptoris nostri opera <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>excudere, quum/qui facile potuisset et labore nullo eo, quod exercitatus in <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName>Zwinglianis</persName> et voces illas in promptu habeat, quibus obscura essent <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>reddenda.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Audio et <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> opera de sacramento scripta iam sub prelum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>adornari, et nos cessabimus et ingrati erimus erga praeceptores nostros?</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Scribe ad <persName ref="p8418">Myconium</persName> nostrum, a quo hauserit dogma sparsum de <placeName>Pelagiani<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>zante</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Curabo literas tuas probe; nam dabo mercatori aut <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiano</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>aut ex nostris nundinis mittam <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiam</placeName> commodissime ad d. <persName>Paceum</persName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>dein curabit <placeName ref="l558">Wittembergam</placeName> perferendas.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 4. octobris 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Mittit tibi hos duos libellos <persName ref="p8126">Oporinus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>noster.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Misissem m. <persName ref="p4926">Gerbelii</persName> librum, si comm<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ode potuisset iste ferre.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName>Henrichus Petri</persName> dabit tibi curatos<note type="margin">a.R.: eher autores</note> istos modico <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>pretio, sicut dat bibliopolus, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>vel, si placet, describam autores, quos eo in libro habet; nam maiorem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>partem habes, scio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Habet epistolas <persName>Ignatii</persName> et <persName>Philonis</persName> quędam Crematii Albini etc.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Fortassis hos autores prius <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>omnes habes.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine meo <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> cum <persName ref="p1214">Frisio</persName>, quem expectamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Dem eherwurdigen <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>und wolgelerten herren herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>, lutpriester zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, mynem gunstigen herren zuͦ handen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
